                <pb facs="0559" n="525" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg525"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr.
                            Sherman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">San
                                Sebastian</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-08-08"><hi rendition="#italic">August 8,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Canovas assassinated to-day by anarchist. Have expressed profound sympathy.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Taylor.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
